The archived v0.1.1 implements an illustrative ranking pipeline with synthetic data.
The v0.2.0 release includes a real-app catalogue, descriptive assessments,
heuristic recommendations and pedagogical preparation tools. Neither version
establishes empirical educational efficacy.

The published source code is a defined subset of the wider ACPA/MSMDA
development project. Separate private components, original research data,
student records and local state are not included.

